abstract: >-
  Data, fitted models, analysis code and figure source tables for capacity-limited
  lake monitoring. The US evaluation covers 2,844 lakes and 130 fortnightly rounds
  during 2021–2025. Regional analyses evaluate absolute and lake-specific relative
  events. The software includes data preparation, single-window and multi-window
  coverage rankers, classifier controls, monitoring schedules and event evaluation.
